{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"8月2日に東京ビックサイトで\n個別握手会がありました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部～4部までたくさんの方が\nあいに来てくださいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とっても楽しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます(｡>ω<｡)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1部の洋服と髪の毛！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/03/7736218/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"目が赤いの最近。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/03/7736218/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へんな顔のひなたんと\n2歳年下のじゅなたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/03/7736218/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まきまきして三つ編みして\nリボンつけたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2部ではひなでびるが\n再び降臨したんだよー！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなさーみんなさー、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なーにやってんだよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すべってるよーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言うけどさ、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなでびるのこと大好きなんでしょー！\n知ってるんだよ～( ¯•ω•¯ )♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなでびる、進化して強くなってツノいつでも簡単にはやせるようになったから\n、またどこかで降臨するぞ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/03/7736218/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"りゃーーーーーーーん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/03/7736218/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ななみさんのブログ照れました♡\nちょっと、いや、ちょっとよりもうちょっとひなでびるで目があった瞬間\nクスッてなってたけど、\nきっとななみさんもひなでびるのこと\n好きだと思います！♡笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなでびるも日奈子もななみさんの事、\nだーーーーいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優しくて面白くて美人で可愛くて、ななみさんを見てると自然と笑顔になれます♡\nななみさんのとこに、よくちょっかいだしに行くんだ～！そーすると、目があってぷくーってほっぺたふくらまします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"キュン死♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3、4部は浴衣をきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何年ぶりだろう！お祭りだいすきで、屋台の周りをあっちこっち走り回るのが好きだったから、浴衣着なかったんだ～！っていうか、着たくなかったの！笑\n動きやすい洋服が好きだった♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、久しぶりの浴衣！\nお母さんと買いに行ってお母さんが選んでくれました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/03/7736218/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メイクさんと日奈子で着付けしたんだよ～！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/08/03/7736218/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん浴衣姿をみて\n喜んでくださって嬉しかったです♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","t